{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/Simple_Battle_2.gif?t=1744846874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fusing Battling tops and Roguelike Deckbuilding together to create an <span class=\"bb_strike\">endless</span>\u00a0\u00a0decent source of battling tops fun! Collect new tops, combine them together, pair 'em up with synergistic relic and go on a short adventure, From the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/Fendry1.gif?t=1744846874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Realistic simulation-:\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Ready, Launch, and Battle!</strong> Use your spinning top to knock your opponents out or simply out last them in a battle of attrition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-With a twist:</i> But these aren't your regular old battling tops, these ones have <strong><i>abilities. </i></strong>Smash at them with full force, build a wall between to defend yourself, Fly high to the sky and strike and many more abilities to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Build the perfect team:\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Collect</strong> new tops and <strong>Combine</strong> them together to create your perfect combination and pair them up with a suitable <strong>relic</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We start From the Top:\u00a0</i>Every time you start a new run, the layout and paths differs slightly every time. Choose paths according to your team and specialty and build the final boss fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/battle3.gif?t=1744846874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From The Top Early Access comes with</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 unique tops with different abilities and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 distinct relic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 boss fights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585160?t=1744846874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585160?t=1744846874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/d7454c4b1d93072b2a1f8eef9d89da8239c7c70c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744846874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/d7454c4b1d93072b2a1f8eef9d89da8239c7c70c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744846874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3639660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/Simple_Battle_2.gif?t=1744846874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fusing Battling tops and Roguelike Deckbuilding together to create an <span class=\"bb_strike\">endless</span>\u00a0\u00a0decent source of battling tops fun! Collect new tops, combine them together, pair 'em up with synergistic relic and go on a short adventure, From the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/Fendry1.gif?t=1744846874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Realistic simulation-:\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong